  message: "IMPLEMENTED on branch jgstern-agent/fix/audit0021-rows (local, not pushed), commit 740a3e70a1 (+ test pin fdb14eb77e). GenServer.call/cast/abcast/multi_call and Process.send/send_after moved ipc_send -> process_send (erlang's gen_server / erlang:send rows). Derived taint sink zone pinned unchanged (ipc). io-boundaries A/B confirms ONLY the label moves: phoenix (call 7, cast 3, send_after 1), plausible (6, 2, 12), livebook (52, 82, 19) move count-for-count; no other primitive pair changes from these rows. Sibling gap filed: WI-vahad-gusib-batop-sosom-vavor-vuzir-napok-bonal (Kernel.send/spawn incl. bare forms, Process.spawn/exit/..., GenServer.reply/start/stop unrowed). Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/ragaz.md (OUTCOME, draft CLOSURE NOTE, A/B artifacts in run_10032026/ragaz/). Tests: red then green on the board; branch affected-test run 9955 passed + 8 failed (7 were pins of the old rows, fixed in fdb14eb77e; 1 hypothesis health-check under load), re-run of those files 1138 passed. No status change made."  # 1d83
